    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wandu kurumiria kaung'a rawo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja mori mirongo iwi na inya ja ugho mori ghoni, wandu wa Israeli wikakwanyika kufunga tumu kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a rawo. Wikakudunga teri vongonyi kwawo, na kurwa nguwo ra magunia kuwonyera wasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Waisraeli wikakutanya na wandu wa kighenyi wose; wikawuka na kurirumiria kaung'a rawo, na makosa gha weke ndee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikakaia kimusi andu koni werekoghe na kushoma chuo cha Sharia ya Mlungu wawo kwa masaa adadu, na kwa masaa ghamu adadu, werekoghe wikirumiria na kumtasa Mlungu wawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korekoghe na kiwayo kwa wundu ghwa Walawi. Jeshua ukakaia kimusi aighu yaro, chiaimweri na Buni, Kadmieli Shabania, Buni, Sherebia, Buni, na Kenani. Wikamlomba BWANA Mlungu wawo kwa lwaka lubaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walawi winughagha wikawanga wandu wichemtasa Mlungu: Jeshua, Kadmieli, Bani, Hashabneia, Sherebia, Hodia, na Shebania, na Pethaya, wikighamba, “Wukenyi mumkase BWANA Mlungu onyu; mkasenyi kwa kala na kala! Kula mundu ndejikase irina jake ja wubaa, hata ngera ndeidimikagha mdamu umkase kwa kukata.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilombi jerumiria kaung'a",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
